      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vanadium-induced changes in the local energy landscape will reduce the barrier for room-temperature dislocation motion or nucleation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The reduced dislocation barrier will activate additional slip systems and produce more uniform low-temperature dislocation activity.",
